// Sit: sitting down at a bonfire, 40 ticks, not looping; it holds its
// last pose while sitting (docs/architecture.md section 11, "模型和动画").
// The game does not lower the node: the clip brings the hips down
// itself, 0.74 m, to just above the ground.
// Rotations are YXZ degrees about each bone's position along the model's
// axes (+X right, +Y up, -Z forward); see assets/anims/README.md for which
// way each bone turns.
//
// Tick 0: standing. 10: crouching, feet planted. 20: squatting low on
// the balls of the feet. 30: sitting cross-legged (the left shin in
// front of the right), the sword across the lap, the left hand on the
// left knee. 40: settled, the head bowed a little.
(
    length: 40,
    looping: false,
    bones: {
        // Down to the ground.
        "hips": (translation: [
            (0, (0.000, 0.000, 0.000)),
            (10, (0.000, -0.300, 0.000)),
            (20, (0.000, -0.550, 0.000)),
            (30, (0.000, -0.740, 0.000)),
            (40, (0.000, -0.740, 0.000)),
        ]),
        // Leaning into it going down, upright sitting, head bowed.
        "spine": (rotation: [
            (0, (0.0, 0.0, 0.0)),
            (10, (-20.0, 0.0, 0.0)),
            (20, (-25.0, 0.0, 0.0)),
            (30, (-6.0, 0.0, 0.0)),
            (40, (-8.0, 0.0, 0.0)),
